  "summary": "The paper proposes a 4-qubit, 2-layer gate-based QESN implemented on PennyLane's default.qubit simulator for Google stock prediction. It reports QESN performance of MSE 0.00021532259308493825 in the text (and 0.00028794590826998 in Table 2), versus classical ESN MSE 0.000668132510319, MAE 0.018752170027431, and RMSE 0.025848259328622. The paper also compares against prior ESN variants, with QESN reporting RMSE 0.0258, MAE 0.017, MAPE 0.08%, and R-squared 0.296 in Table 3.",
